---
// The margin rail of brand spec 9 and 10: five short marks, the second one
// accent and taller, fixed, with no motion. The home hero and the hero of each
// other root page show it. The page sets the column and the top padding.
---
<div class="rail" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span class="rail-accent"></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
<style>
  .rail { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: var(--at-unit); }
  .rail span { display: block; width: var(--at-rail); height: 1.5rem; background: var(--at-line); }
  .rail .rail-accent { height: 3rem; background: var(--at-accent); }
</style>
